ed English.","wrong":{"My brother has studied English yesterday.":"yesterday bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","My brother already studied English.":"V3 yolg‘iz kelmaydi: have / has + V3.","My brother have already studied English.":"My brother bilan has."}},{"answer":"Grandpa has already spoken English.","explain":"already → Present Perfect: Grandpa has already spoken English.","wrong":{"Grandpa has spoken English yesterday.":"yesterday bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","Grandpa already spoken English.":"V3 yolg‘iz kelmaydi: have / has + V3.","Grandpa have already spoken English.":"Grandpa bilan has."}},{"answer":"He has already visited the museum.","explain":"already → Present Perfect: He has already visited the museum.","wrong":{"He has visited the museum yesterday.":"yesterday bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","He already visited the museum.":"V3 yolg‘iz kelmaydi: have / has + V3.","He have already visited the museum.":"He bilan has."}},{"answer":"Grandpa has already listened to music.","explain":"already → Present Perfect: Grandpa has already listened to music.","wrong":{"Grandpa has listened to music yesterday.":"yesterday bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","Grandpa already listened to music.":"V3 yolg‘iz kelmaydi: have / has + V3.","Grandpa have already listened to music.":"Grandpa bilan has."}},{"answer":"Grandpa has already taken a photo.","explain":"already → Present Perfect: Grandpa has already taken a photo.","wrong":{"Grandpa has taken a photo yesterday.":"yesterday bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","Grandpa already taken a photo.":"V3 yolg‘iz kelmaydi: have / has + V3.","Grandpa have already taken a photo.":"Grandpa bilan has."}},{"answer":"The children visited the museum last week.","explain":"Aniq vaqt → Past Simple: The children visited the museum last week.","wrong":{"The children have visited the museum last week.":"“last week” bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","The children did visit the museum last week.":"Darak gapda did q