ek.","wrong":{"Ali and Vali have read a book last week.":"“last week” bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","Ali and Vali did read a book last week.":"Darak gapda did qo‘yilmaydi.","Ali and Vali were read a book last week.":"was / were + asl fe’l — xato."}},{"answer":"You helped the teacher yesterday.","explain":"Aniq vaqt → Past Simple: You helped the teacher yesterday.","wrong":{"You have helped the teacher yesterday.":"“yesterday” bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","You did help the teacher yesterday.":"Darak gapda did qo‘yilmaydi.","You have help the teacher yesterday.":"have + asl fe’l — xato."}},{"answer":"My mother made a cake last night.","explain":"Aniq vaqt → Past Simple: My mother made a cake last night.","wrong":{"My mother has made a cake last night.":"“last night” bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","My mother did make a cake last night.":"Darak gapda did qo‘yilmaydi.","My mother has make a cake last night.":"have + asl fe’l — xato."}},{"answer":"Malika has already sent a message.","explain":"already → Present Perfect: Malika has already sent a message.","wrong":{"Malika has sent a message yesterday.":"yesterday bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","Malika already sent a message.":"V3 yolg‘iz kelmaydi: have / has + V3.","Malika have already sent a message.":"Malika bilan has."}},{"answer":"We took a photo yesterday.","explain":"Aniq vaqt → Past Simple: We took a photo yesterday.","wrong":{"We have taken a photo yesterday.":"“yesterday” bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","We have took a photo yesterday.":"Vaqt aniq → Past Simple, have / has kerak emas.","We did take a photo yesterday.":"Darak gapda did qo‘yilmaydi."}},{"answer":"My brother has already built a sandcastle.","explain":"already → Present Perfect: My brother has already built a sandcastle.","wrong":{"My brother has built a sandcastle yesterday.":"yesterday bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","My brother already built a sandcastle.":"V3 yolg‘iz kelmaydi: have / has + V3.","My brother have already built a sandcastle.":"My brother bilan has."}},{"answer":"Mr Brown has already run in the park.","explain":"already → Present Perfect: Mr Brown has already run in the park.","wrong":{"Mr Brown has run in the park yesterday.":"yesterday bilan Present Perfect ishlatilmaydi.","Mr Brown already run in the park.":"V3 yolg‘iz kelmaydi: have / has + V3.","Mr Brown have already run in the park.":"Mr Brown bilan has."}}]}$q$::jsonb from t
